---

This project derives from and ships build outputs based on the Système de
Design de l'État français (DSFR), © DINUM / Service d'Information du
Gouvernement, also licensed under MIT (see https://github.com/GouvernementFR/dsfr).

Notes on third-party assets shipped in `dist/` :

- The Marianne typeface (excluded from the DSFR MIT license) is NOT shipped.
  The default mapping replaces it with Public Sans (SIL OFL,
  https://github.com/uswds/public-sans).
- Spectral typeface is shipped under SIL OFL.
- The official État branding (header, footer, logos) is reserved to authorized
  Entities (DSFR CGU art. 2). Components carrying these are excluded from the
  default build via `mapping.components.remove`.
- Lucide icons (overrides + adds) are licensed under the Lucide ISC license
  (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide).
